    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates applying a daily loss limit to prevent decision deterioration using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示使用单日亏损上限防止决策恶化。"
    },
